= Equalising Coinpurses

The current presents a wealth register, a net-wealth levy, an exit charge and
enforcement against capital flight as one political test. Finance officials
say the first three can be legislated. The fourth becomes dangerous if the
money moves before Parliament does.

Socialist line: **[+ hard_left_line_label +]**. KO relation: **[+ ko_relation
+]/100**. Lewica polling: **[+ left_poll +]%**. Acceptance of capitalism:
**[+ capitalism_acceptance +]/100**. Legal exposure: **[+
hard_left_exposure +]/100**.

- @coinpurses_statute
- @coinpurses_unlawful
- @coinpurses_enforcement
- @coinpurses_refuse

@coinpurses_statute
title: Legislate the wealth register, levy and exit charge
subtitle: A lawful confrontation with accumulated wealth. Budget capacity rises; liberal relations and polling fall.
on-arrival: budget += 3; budget_balance += 1; fiscal_stress -= 2; hard_left_line += 11; razem_strength += 3; progressives_strength += 1; razem_dissent -= 8; progressives_dissent -= 6; razem_cooperation += 6; workers_support += 4; young_support += 3; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 4; social_spending_support += 3; social_spending_left_ownership += 4; welfare_expectation += 3; left_economic_position -= 5; left_right_score -= 4; capitalism_acceptance -= 8; ko_relation -= 9; p2050_relation -= 7; psl_relation -= 5; left_poll -= 0.7; public_trust -= 2; government_coalition_dissent += 6; barons_dissent += 6; spring_dissent += 4; market_liberal_support += 8; constitutional_restraint += 2; news_headline = "Government introduces a wealth register, levy and exit charge"

The bill gives every threshold, appeal and valuation rule a statutory basis.
It is constitutional process used for a result the centre regards as an
attack on the settlement itself.

- #poland_card_finish

@coinpurses_unlawful
title: Unlawful: impose emergency capital controls by executive order
subtitle: Stop transfers before Parliament acts. Pursue it only by accepting major constitutional and coalition damage.
on-arrival: budget += 2; budget_balance += 1; hard_left_line += 14; hard_left_exposure += 18; razem_strength += 4; progressives_strength += 2; razem_dissent -= 10; progressives_dissent -= 8; razem_cooperation += 7; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 6; anti_system_trust += 5; capitalism_acceptance -= 10; ko_relation -= 13; p2050_relation -= 10; psl_relation -= 8; left_poll -= 1.2; public_trust -= 5; government_coalition_dissent += 11; early_election_risk += 7; constitutional_restraint -= 10; government_procedural_restraint -= 10; judicial_legitimacy -= 7; legal_dualism += 11; market_liberal_support += 10; news_headline = "Cabinet claims emergency power to stop capital transfers"

Banks receive a binding instruction before any act creates the power to issue
it. The measure may hold money in the country for the vote. Courts may hold
that government has invented a financial law by circular.

- #poland_card_finish

@coinpurses_enforcement
title: Fund tax enforcement without changing ownership or rates
subtitle: A technocratic revenue drive reassures the centre. Razem and progressives reject the substitution.
on-arrival: budget += 1; fiscal_stress -= 1; public_trust += 2; institutional_trust += 2; ko_relation += 2; p2050_relation += 1; constitutional_restraint += 2; hard_left_line += 2; razem_dissent += 5; progressives_dissent += 4; razem_cooperation -= 3; market_liberal_support += 2; news_headline = "Government substitutes tax enforcement for a wealth levy"

More auditors recover real money and close obvious avoidance routes. Wealth
remains private, unregistered as a class and untouched by a new rate.

- #poland_card_finish

