= The Pharmaceutical, the Chemical

Medicine shortages and strategic dependence give the current its sharpest
case. It wants public control of refining, bulk chemicals and essential-drug
production. Lawyers agree Parliament can nationalise with compensation. Some
organisers ask why shareholders should be paid before patients are supplied.

Socialist line: **[+ hard_left_line_label +]**. KO relation: **[+ ko_relation
+]/100**. Lewica polling: **[+ left_poll +]%**. Acceptance of capitalism:
**[+ capitalism_acceptance +]/100**. Legal exposure: **[+
hard_left_exposure +]/100**.

