card-image: img/poland/cards/government-affairs.webp

= A Controversial Argument for Nationalisation

The last interventions were defended as exceptions: one failed operator, one
security risk, one shortage. Razem now asks cabinet to admit a principle.
Where a sector governs basic life, democratic ownership may be better than a
regulated private monopoly.

Socialist line: **[+ hard_left_line_label +]**. KO relation: **[+ ko_relation
+]/100**. Lewica polling: **[+ left_poll +]%**. Acceptance of capitalism:
**[+ capitalism_acceptance +]/100**. Strategic nationalisations: **[+
strategic_nationalisations +]**.

- @nationalisation_doctrine
- @nationalisation_plural
- @nationalisation_cases
- @nationalisation_refuse

@nationalisation_doctrine
title: Adopt democratic public ownership as cabinet doctrine
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. Prepare compensated acquisitions across natural monopolies and essential sectors.
choose-if: budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Valuation teams and the public holding company need two budget points.
on-arrival: budget -= 2; fiscal_stress += 2; strategic_nationalisations += 2; hard_left_line += 14; razem_strength += 5; progressives_strength += 1; pps_strength += 1; razem_dissent -= 11; progressives_dissent -= 7; pps_dissent -= 4; razem_cooperation += 9; workers_support += 5; public_sector_support += 5; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 5; labor_credibility += 4; universal_solidarity += 4; left_economic_position -= 6; left_right_score -= 5; capitalism_acceptance -= 11; ko_relation -= 12; p2050_relation -= 9; psl_relation -= 7; left_poll -= 1.0; public_trust -= 3; government_coalition_dissent += 10; early_election_risk += 4; barons_dissent += 8; spring_dissent += 5; market_liberal_support += 11; constitutional_restraint += 2; news_headline = "Cabinet adopts democratic public ownership as an economic doctrine"

The resolution requires statutes, compensation and worker and consumer seats
on public boards. It also ends the pretence that nationalisation is an
embarrassing accident rather than a legitimate instrument.

- #poland_card_finish

@nationalisation_plural
title: Build municipal, cooperative and national ownership together
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. A plural socialist model broadens support while still moving assets out of private control.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The ownership conversion fund needs one budget point.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; strategic_nationalisations += 1; hard_left_line += 9; razem_strength += 3; pps_strength += 2; progressives_strength += 1; razem_dissent -= 7; progressives_dissent -= 5; pps_dissent -= 5; razem_cooperation += 6; workers_support += 4; rural_support += 2; local_network += 3; movement_autonomy += 3; left_economic_position -= 4; capitalism_acceptance -= 6; ko_relation -= 6; p2050_relation -= 4; psl_relation -= 4; left_poll -= 0.4; government_coalition_dissent += 5; market_liberal_support += 6; news_headline = "Government backs municipal, cooperative and national ownership conversions"

Not every public asset sits in Warsaw. Municipalities, workers and the state
receive different forms for different sectors, with private ownership no
longer treated as the default from which every deviation needs an apology.

- #poland_card_finish

@nationalisation_cases
title: Keep nationalisation case by case
subtitle: Intervene only after market failure. The centre is reassured; the current rejects permanent exceptionalism.
on-arrival: strategic_nationalisations += 1; government_delivery += 2; public_trust += 2; institutional_trust += 1; ko_relation += 2; p2050_relation += 1; psl_relation += 1; hard_left_line += 2; razem_dissent += 6; progressives_dissent += 4; pps_dissent += 3; razem_cooperation -= 3; coalition_blur += 3; news_headline = "Cabinet keeps public ownership an exceptional remedy for market failure"

The government may still buy a collapsing operator or protect a security
asset. It refuses to say why profitable private power should ever qualify.

- #poland_card_finish

