card-image: img/poland/cards/oversight-delivery.webp

= Modern Monetary Theory

The current argues that unemployment, resources and inflation are real
constraints while a household analogy is not. Its programme couples a job
guarantee to active taxation and debt management. A louder faction wants the
NBP ordered to finance the deficit directly, despite Article 220(2).

Socialist line: **[+ hard_left_line_label +]**. KO relation: **[+ ko_relation
+]/100**. Lewica polling: **[+ left_poll +]%**. Acceptance of capitalism:
**[+ capitalism_acceptance +]/100**. Inflation: **[+ inflation +]%**. Legal
exposure: **[+ hard_left_exposure +]/100**.

- @mmt_framework
- @mmt_unlawful
- @mmt_balances
- @mmt_refuse

@mmt_framework
title: Adopt MMT and a statute-based job guarantee
subtitle: Cost: 3 budget capacity. Use normal fiscal law, taxes and bond operations; accept inflation and coalition risk.
choose-if: budget >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: Launching the job guarantee needs three budget points.
on-arrival: budget -= 3; fiscal_stress += 4; public_debt += 4; budget_balance -= 3; inflation += 1.2; unemployment -= 1.0; economic_growth += 0.7; mmt_doctrine_adopted = 1; hard_left_line += 14; razem_strength += 5; progressives_strength += 2; pps_strength += 1; razem_dissent -= 11; progressives_dissent -= 8; pps_dissent -= 4; razem_cooperation += 9; workers_support += 6; young_support += 4; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 6; social_spending_support += 4; social_spending_salience += 4; social_spending_left_ownership += 5; welfare_expectation += 5; left_economic_position -= 6; left_right_score -= 5; capitalism_acceptance -= 11; ko_relation -= 12; p2050_relation -= 10; psl_relation -= 7; left_poll -= 1.0; public_trust -= 3; government_coalition_dissent += 10; early_election_risk += 5; barons_dissent += 8; market_liberal_support += 11; constitutional_restraint += 2; news_headline = "Government adopts MMT and a statute-based job guarantee"

The programme does not command the central bank. Parliament taxes, spends and
issues debt under existing law while treating full employment as the target
and inflation as the binding limit.

- #poland_card_finish

@mmt_unlawful
title: Unlawful: instruct the NBP to finance the deficit directly
subtitle: Article 220(2) forbids this route. Pursue it only by accepting constitutional conflict and legal dualism.
on-arrival: budget += 4; budget_balance -= 5; public_debt += 2; inflation += 2.5; unemployment -= 0.8; economic_growth += 0.5; mmt_doctrine_adopted = 1; hard_left_line += 17; hard_left_exposure += 24; razem_strength += 6; progressives_strength += 2; pps_strength += 1; razem_dissent -= 13; progressives_dissent -= 10; pps_dissent -= 5; razem_cooperation += 10; workers_support += 6; young_support += 5; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 8; anti_system_trust += 7; capitalism_acceptance -= 13; ko_relation -= 16; p2050_relation -= 13; psl_relation -= 10; left_poll -= 1.7; public_trust -= 7; government_coalition_dissent += 15; early_election_risk += 12; constitutional_restraint -= 15; government_procedural_restraint -= 14; judicial_legitimacy -= 10; legal_dualism += 15; prosecution_independence -= 5; market_liberal_support += 14; news_headline = "Cabinet orders direct NBP financing despite Article 220"

The instruction is not a creative reading. The Constitution expressly bars
the central bank from covering the budget deficit. Cabinet can issue the
order, but it cannot make the prohibition disappear by renaming the transfer.

- #poland_card_finish

@mmt_balances
title: Publish sectoral balances and keep conventional financing
subtitle: Let MMT inform forecasts without adopting its programme. Technocrats approve; the current remains dissatisfied.
on-arrival: fiscal_stress -= 1; institutional_trust += 2; public_trust += 2; inflation -= 0.1; ko_relation += 2; p2050_relation += 1; constitutional_restraint += 2; hard_left_line += 3; razem_dissent += 6; progressives_dissent += 4; pps_dissent += 2; razem_cooperation -= 3; coalition_blur += 3; news_headline = "Treasury adopts sectoral-balance reporting without MMT policy"

The forecasts improve and the household metaphor disappears from official
documents. Fiscal rules, unemployment tolerances and the financing model do
not change.

- #poland_card_finish

